---
// Calm, natural emerald hero with organic honey/blossom background photo
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-emerald-950 text-white">
  <!-- Subtle natural background photo (sunlit honey & blossoms on wood) -->
  <img
    src="/images/products/product-04.jpg"
    alt=""
    aria-hidden="true"
    width="1280"
    height="853"
    loading="eager"
    fetchpriority="high"
    decoding="async"
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center opacity-35"
  />
  <!-- Calm natural emerald gradient overlay -->
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-l from-emerald-950/90 via-emerald-900/80 to-emerald-950/75"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8 sm:py-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-6 md:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 text-center md:text-right">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-800/80 border border-emerald-500/30 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-100 mb-3">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-300"></span>
          طبيعي ١٠٠٪ بدون أي إضافات أو مواد حافظة
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-snug text-white mb-3">
          منتجات الحسيني{" "}
          <span class="text-amber-300 block sm:inline">طبيعي .. أصيل .. فاخر</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-emerald-100/90 mb-5 max-w-xl mx-auto md:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
          طحينة سمسم خام، عسل نحل طبيعي، زبدة فول سوداني، وزيت زيتون بكر ممتاز — من إنتاجنا لباب بيتك في كل محافظات مصر.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3">
          <a
            href="#products"
            class="rounded-xl bg-amber-400 px-6 py-2.5 sm:py-3 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-emerald-950 hover:bg-amber-300 transition-colors shadow-sm"
          >
            تسوق الآن
          </a>
          <a
            href="/products"
            class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-400/40 bg-emerald-900/60 px-5 py-2.5 sm:py-3 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-800/80 transition-colors"
          >
            كل المنتجات والعروض
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Featured Brand Visual (hidden on very small screens or compact card) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 mx-auto w-full max-w-xs sm:max-w-sm md:max-w-full">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-emerald-400/25 bg-emerald-900/40 p-1.5 shadow-xl">
          <img
            src="/images/products/product-03.jpg"
            alt="تشكيلة منتجات الحسيني الطبيعية"
            width="800"
            height="800"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Compact Trust Strip -->
<div class="border-b border-emerald-100 dark:border-gray-800 bg-emerald-50/70 dark:bg-gray-900/80">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-3 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center text-[11px] sm:text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200">
    <div>✓ خامات طبيعية ١٠٠٪</div>
    <div>✓ توصيل لحد عندك</div>
    <div>✓ دفع آمن عند الطلب</div>
  </div>
</div>
